      "text": "On the hundred bugs: sixty-six verified fixes, zero false ones shipped, about forty cents of Nemotron tokens each. It all ran on Nebius Token Factory: eighty-seven million Nemotron tokens, nearly five hundred sandboxes. That's what I want before I merge anything an agent wrote: a receipt I can re-run. On another repo, it's one command and a failing test.",
